{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an exciting space shooting game. Players will pilot their own spaceships and navigate through the vast and mysterious cosmic starry sky. In this deep expanse of stars, danger lurks everywhere - enemy spaceships of various shapes emerge like ghosts, firing dense red bullet barrages in an attempt to destroy the player's craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to rely on keen reflexes and excellent operating skills to nimbly dodge enemy attacks, while using the weapons equipped on their ships to counterattack. When accurately hitting enemies, gorgeous explosion effects are triggered, delivering a strong visual impact. This game not only tests players' shooting accuracy but also requires outstanding maneuvering abilities and strategic planning awareness - survive the hail of bullets, eliminate all enemies, and experience the thrill of conquering the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come join this heart-pounding interstellar adventure and become the master of the cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Methods</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WASD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire: Left Mouse Button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust Fire Direction: Move Mouse </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740050?t=1756516501","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740050?t=1756516501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740050/07ab608af677925d016080d303dc38f6c617574d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756516501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740050/07ab608af677925d016080d303dc38f6c617574d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756516501","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"d